#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.apply.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.apply"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:1 of
msgid "Apply ``func`` per column (axis=0) or per row (axis=1)."
msgstr "按列(axis=0)或按行(axis=1)应用``func``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:3 of
msgid "Mirrors ``pandas.DataFrame.apply``:"
msgstr "镜像 ``pandas.DataFrame.apply``："

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:5 of
msgid ""
"``axis=0``: ``func`` receives each column as a Series and may return a "
"scalar, Series, or DataFrame.  All row chunks are concatenated first so "
"the UDF sees the whole column."
msgstr ""
"``axis=0``: ``func`` 将每列作为 Series 接收，并可以返回标量、Series 或 "
"DataFrame。所有行块首先被连接，因此 UDF 可以看到整列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:8 of
msgid ""
"``axis=1``: ``func`` receives each row as a Series and may return a "
"scalar, Series, or dict.  Results are combined one output row per input "
"row.  Because per-row UDFs are not mock-inferable from the whole frame, "
"``axis=1`` generally requires explicit ``dtypes`` or a return type "
"annotation."
msgstr ""
"``axis=1``: ``func`` 将每行作为 Series 接收，并可以返回标量、Series 或"
"字典。结果按每输入行对应一个输出行进行组合。由于逐行 UDF 无法从整个框架中"
"模拟推断，``axis=1`` 通常需要显式的 ``dtypes`` 或返回类型注解。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:14 of
msgid ""
"Function taking a Series (a column for ``axis=0``, a row for ``axis=1``) "
"and returning a scalar, Series, dict, or DataFrame.  If ``func`` is a "
"class, it is instantiated once per chunk, ``__call__`` is invoked per "
"column (``axis=0``) or per row (``axis=1``), and ``close()`` (if defined)"
" is always called at the end of the chunk — even when ``__call__`` "
"receives single rows/columns."
msgstr ""
"接收一个 Series（对于 ``axis=0`` 是一列，对于 ``axis=1`` 是一行）并返回"
"标量、Series、字典或 DataFrame 的函数。如果 ``func`` 是一个类，则每个块"
"实例化一次，每个列（``axis=0``）或每行（``axis=1``）调用 ``__call__``，"
"并且在块结束时总是调用 ``close()``（如果已定义）——即使 ``__call__`` 接收"
"单个行/列也是如此。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:23 of
msgid "``axis=0`` iterates over columns; ``axis=1`` iterates over rows."
msgstr "``axis=0`` 遍历列；``axis=1`` 遍历行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:25 of
msgid ""
"Only applies when ``axis=1``.  Controls how list-like results (dict, list"
", Series) are combined into the output frame:  * ``None`` (default): ``"
"Series`` results are auto-expanded to   columns (matching pandas, where a"
" per-row ``Series`` is combined   into a multi-column frame).  ``dict`` "
"and ``list`` results are   kept as a single object column (one cell per "
"row) — pandas 2.3.3   does not expand dict keys or lists unless ``result_"
"type='expand'``   is given; declaring multiple columns for a dict / list "
"result   raises. * ``\"expand\"``: dict / list / Series results are "
"always expanded   to columns (dict keys / positional indices / Series "
"index   become column names). * ``\"reduce\"``: dict / list results are "
"kept as a single column   of objects (one cell per row), matching pandas "
"  ``result_type='reduce'``.  ``Series`` results are still expanded   to "
"columns (pandas behavior). * ``\"broadcast\"``: results are broadcast to "
"the original input   shape — the output has the same column names as the "
"input.   Requires list-like results whose length matches the input   "
"column count."
msgstr ""
"仅在 ``axis=1`` 时适用。控制列表类结果（字典、列表、Series）如何合并到"
"输出框架中：* ``None``（默认值）：``Series`` 结果自动扩展为列（匹配 "
"pandas，其中每行的 ``Series`` 组合成多列框架）。``dict`` 和 ``list`` 结果"
"保留为单个对象列（每行一个单元格）——pandas 2.3.3 不会展开字典键或列表，"
"除非给出 ``result_type='expand'``；为字典/列表结果声明多个列会引发异常。*"
" ``\"expand\"``：字典/列表/Series 结果始终扩展为列（字典键/位置索引/"
"Series 索引成为列名）。* ``\"reduce\"``：字典/列表结果保留为单个对象列（"
"每行一个单元格），匹配 pandas 的 ``result_type='reduce'``。``Series`` "
"结果仍然扩展为列（pandas 行为）。* ``\"broadcast\"``：结果广播到原始输入"
"形状——输出具有与输入相同的列名。需要长度与输入列数匹配的类列表结果。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:47 of
msgid ""
"Expected output dtypes.  If omitted, inferred from ``func``'s return "
"annotation or a mock call."
msgstr "期望的输出数据类型。如果省略，则从 ``func`` 的返回注解或模拟调用中推断。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:50 of
msgid "If True, skip dtype inference and produce an untyped output."
msgstr "如果为 True，跳过数据类型推断并产生无类型的输出。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:52 of
msgid "Frame type passed to ``func``."
msgstr "传递给 ``func`` 的框架类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:54 of
msgid "Extra positional arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外位置参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:56 of
msgid "Extra keyword arguments forwarded to ``func``."
msgstr "转发给 ``func`` 的额外关键字参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply:58 of
msgid ""
"A new LiteFrame whose dtypes match the (inferred or explicit) output "
"schema."
msgstr "一个新的 LiteFrame，其数据类型匹配（推断或显式）输出模式。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.functional.apply.apply of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

